        "html": "<h2>Site owner</h2>\n<p>This website is owned by the Education, Culture and Universities Ministry\n(Generalitat Valenciana), with offices at Avenida de Campanar, 32. 46015 València and\ntelephone 96 386 60 00.</p>\n<p>The AI-STEAM Network is a platform of the Valencian Community for connecting the ecosystem of\nartificial intelligence applied to STEAM education, within the AI-SECRETT project of the Digital\nEurope Programme.</p>\n<h2>Purpose</h2>\n<p>This site provides information about the network, its sectors, its training offer, its knowledge\nresources and its governance, as well as access to the participation and membership forms.</p>\n<p>Use of the site is <strong>free of charge</strong>, and requires no registration or account.</p>\n<h2>Terms of use</h2>\n<p>By using this site you undertake to do so in accordance with the law, in good faith and under\nthese terms, and not to use it for unlawful purposes or in ways that harm the rights of others.</p>\n<p>In particular, the following is prohibited:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Using the site as a means to carry out acts contrary to applicable law.</li>\n<li>Introducing or distributing programs, code or data capable of damaging the site, its systems or\nother people&#39;s equipment.</li>\n<li>Removing, altering or tampering with the site&#39;s protection or identification mechanisms, or those\nof its contents.</li>\n<li>Distributing content that infringes fundamental rights, in particular content inciting hatred,\nviolence or discrimination.</li>\n<li>Using third-party distinctive signs or trade marks without their owner&#39;s authorisation.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Intellectual property and reuse</h2>\n<p>The contents of this site — text, images, design, code and structure — belong to the\nEducation, Culture and Universities Ministry or to third parties who have authorised their use, and are protected\nby intellectual property law.</p>\n<p>You may freely <strong>quote</strong> the contents, stating their source. Reproduction, distribution\nor transformation for other purposes is subject to the rules on the reuse of public sector\ninformation and, where a particular resource states its own licence, to the terms of that licence.\nIf in doubt, you may consult the site owner beforehand.</p>\n<p>Materials published as open educational resources are governed by the licence stated on each of\nthem.</p>\n<h2>Links to other sites</h2>\n<p>This site contains links to external pages, including the\nparticipation forms, which are hosted on an external service. By following them you leave this site\nand become subject to the terms and privacy policies of their owners, over which this Ministry has\nno control. Their inclusion does not imply agreement with their content or any relationship with\nthose who operate them.</p>\n<h2>Liability</h2>\n<p>This site is provided with all due care, but neither the absence of errors nor uninterrupted\navailability is guaranteed; the service may be affected by maintenance work or by causes beyond our\ncontrol.</p>\n<p>The information published is <strong>for information purposes</strong> and does not replace official\npublications. Communications with legal effect must be made through the official channels of the\nGeneralitat Valenciana.</p>\n<p>No liability is accepted for damage arising from improper use of the site, for the contents of\nexternal pages linked to, or for the operation of outdated or misconfigured equipment or browsers.</p>\n<h2>Data protection and cookies</h2>\n<p>This site <strong>does not place cookies</strong> and does not ask you for any data. The participation forms are\nhosted on an external service, and both their processing and the server&#39;s technical logs are\nexplained in the <strong>Privacy policy</strong>, together with how to exercise your rights.</p>\n<p>Full details are available in the <strong>Privacy policy</strong> and the <strong>Cookie policy</strong> on this site.</p>\n<h2>Applicable law</h2>\n<p>These terms are governed by Spanish law. Any dispute shall be settled by the courts having\njurisdiction in accordance with the law.</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<p>This notice may be amended to reflect changes in legislation or in the site itself. The version and\ndate shown at the top identify the text in force at any given time.</p>",
